  "instruction": "The incident-data reader batch is in the queue and there is an open bulk-grant finding on the lake, so a straight grant is off the table right now. Work out which readers already hold the attestation and can go on an exception with the compensating control, which are blocked on a lapsed or expiring attestation, and which must be refused. One contractor wants the export role thrown in without a manager attestation and says it is basically the same thing. Enter the exception the approval supports for the eligible cohort, then draft the note for the security lead with who is covered, who has to attest, and what was refused.",
